  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" style=\"font-size: 88%; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\n<caption class=\"summary\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold\">United States presidential election, 2136\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/d/de/Flag_of_the_United_States.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20170818144039\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of the United States.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_the_United_States.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:left;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2132\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2132\">2132</a>&#160;←<br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;\"><b>November 6, 2136</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:right;\" class=\"noprint\">→&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2140\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2140\">2140</a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><small>All eligible voters who turned out</small><br /><small>51% of votes votes needed to win</small>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Turnout\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center\">66.0%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/89/Halvidar_Blank.png/revision/latest?cb=20151024200819\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Halvidar Blank\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/89/Halvidar_Blank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20151024200819\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Halvidar Blank.png\" data-image-key=\"Halvidar_Blank.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20150810222433\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Lionel_Halvidar\" title=\"Lionel Halvidar\">Lionel Halvidar</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Sarima Haden\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Lydia Monroe\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Union Party\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Progress\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Conservative Union\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mars\" title=\"Mars\">Bradbury Territory</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">South Australia</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">New York</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/President_of_the_United_States\" title=\"President of the United States\">Cora Fabian</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Josiah Vasquez\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Harrison Reed\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>360,437,185</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">22,353,195\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">59,261,645\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>81.5%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">5.1%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">13.4%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left; text-size: 80%\"><b>President before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Lionel_Halvidar\" title=\"Lionel Halvidar\">Lionel Halvidar</a><br />\nUnion\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right; text-size: 80%\"><b>Elected President</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Lionel_Halvidar\" title=\"Lionel Halvidar\">Lionel Halvidar</a><br />\nUnion\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>United States presidential election of 2136</b> was the 88th quadrennial presidential election, held on Tuesday, November 6, 2136. In this match, incumbent Unionist president Lionel Halvidar ran for reelection against Conservative-Union candidate Lydia Monroe, who tried to portray himself to the voters as the \"peace candidate\" who wanted to bring the <a href=\"/wiki/Third_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Third Mexican-American War\">Third Mexican-American War</a> to a speedy end. Sarima Haden ran on behalf of the Progressive \"Peace-wing,\" after Halvidar secured the endorsement of the Progress Party. Halvidar was re-elected president by a landslide, partly helped by the admission of several new states from Mars and Luna.\n</p><p>As Mexico had annexed the rebel states of the South West, no votes were counted from any of the eleven southern states that had joined the United States of Aztlan.\n</p><p>Halvidar won with 81.5% of the popular vote on the first ballot, a record only ever beaten by James Monroe and George Washington who both ran unopposed. Halvidar's victory was partly the result of the recent victory at the Battle of Washington, where Halvidar took the field and directly commanded troops during the final hours of the battle. Halvidar's popularity had surged after the victory of DC, and the war had begun to turn in America's favor as a result of the colonies admission into the war.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081338\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2560/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12400/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4066/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 9/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1031975/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   79.865      1 Template:Infobox_election\n100.00%   79.865      1 -total\n 80.68%   64.438      3 Template:Infobox_election/row\n 34.78%   27.780     10 Template:Ifempty\n  6.68%    5.331      1 Template:Flagicon\n  6.30%    5.030      5 Template:Infobox_election/shortname\n  4.56%    3.638      1 Template:Country_data_United_States\n  2.02%    1.611      1 Template:Flagicon/core\n  2.02%    1.611     42 Template:!-\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:956-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119081338 and revision id 4638. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
